    <string name="flip_tutorial_page1_title">Meet Your Keyboard</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page1_description">F1–F3: three custom shortcut keys\nF4: Bluetooth pairing\nF10–F12: switch between devices 1–3\nSlide the side switch to ON; next to it is the USB-C charging port\nThe cable plugs into the back, and the keyboard works while wired</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page2_title">Match the System to Your Device</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page2_description">Pick the right system for each device so shortcuts work\nAndroid phones and tablets: choose Android (Samsung Galaxy: Samsung)\nChoose it in the app and the keyboard applies it automatically\nOn the keyboard: Fn + E (iOS) / Q (Android) / W (Windows) / S (Samsung)</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page3_title">Type-C Wired Connection</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page3_description">Plug in USB-C and switch on; it works while the keyboard charges\nWhile charging the keyboard, your device can charge at the same time\nWired mode is fixed to Copy, Paste, Select All\nFor other custom shortcuts, connect the keyboard over Bluetooth to set them up and use them</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page4_title">Set Up Shortcuts</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page4_description">Open a device, then pick an App and a Function per key\nChanges are written to the keyboard automatically\nReset restores Copy, Paste, Select All</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page5_title">Set the Sleep Timer</string>
    <string name="flip_tutorial_page5_description">Drag the slider: sleep after 1–15 minutes idle\nPress any key to wake\nShared by all three devices</string>
